[PrintTextModified Text:——轰隆轰隆。<br>此时响起一阵巨大声响，足以震动整座监牢。|#0103Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……怎么了……？|#0103Adv14_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛微微睁开眼睛。<br>她正躺在已经熟悉的地下牢房的床上。|#0103Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地震……？|#0103Adv14_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾、艾玛！<br>出、出大事了～！|#0103Adv14_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜冲进了<br>艾玛的牢房。|#0103Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，汉娜早上好……<br>这声音是什么……？|#0103Adv14_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:是雪莉！<br>雪莉在闹事～！|#0103Adv14_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸！？<br>为、为什么！？|#0103Adv14_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一下子清醒了过来，<br>慌忙下了床。|#0103Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个猩猩女！<br>我就知道她迟早会失控！|#0103Adv14_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:闹事能解决什么啊，<br>根本不可能嘛！|#0103Adv14_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:居然想要破坏监牢，<br>说不定会被看守杀掉的！|#0103Adv14_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪里像个头脑派侦探啊～！<br>脑子里根本全都是肌肉～！|#0103Adv14_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜似乎也陷入了恐慌，<br>眼睛转来转去，慌乱不已。|#0103Adv14_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，冷静点……<br>总之，我们得去阻止她！|#0103Adv14_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和汉娜<br>跌跌撞撞地冲出牢房。|#0103Adv14_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

