[PrintTextModified Text:宅邸内的过道上，窗户破碎，<br>墙壁被打穿，一片狼藉。|#0103Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目前的巨响是从图书室方向传来的。<br>艾玛和汉娜冲了进去。|#0103Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:深处的书架像多米诺骨牌一样倒下，<br>宛如地震后的景象。<br>书本散落一地，一片混乱。|#0103Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛、汉娜，<br>早上好啊。|#0103Adv14_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉仿佛什么事都没发生似的，<br>笑眯眯地打招呼。|#0103Adv14_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你到底在想什么！|#0103Adv14_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊雪莉，<br>把监牢大宅弄得一团糟，<br>你到底想干什么？|#0103Adv14_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR13

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉得意地竖起食指。<br>|#0103Adv14_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你想，不是经常有那种情况吗，<br>移动书架就会出现暗室的开关。|#0103Adv14_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR17

[PrintTextModified Text:我就在想会不会有这种东西，<br>所以在找找看。|#0103Adv14_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:就算这样，<br>这么闹也会被看守抓去惩罚室的！|#0103Adv14_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:规定里没说不能破坏监牢内部，<br>所以没问题哦。|#0103Adv14_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那是因为<br>只有你这种人才能做出这种破坏行为吧。|#0103Adv14_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……不过，看守确实没来。<br>　平时的话应该立刻就会赶到的）|#0103Adv14_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（或许只要没违反规定，<br>　做任何事都是受允许的……）|#0103Adv14_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:就算是这样，也有可能会被惩罚的。<br>我觉得还是不该这样做……|#0103Adv14_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 暴れて破壊する音2
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_177 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉完全不听劝，<br>继续她的破坏行动。|#0103Adv14_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你就不能安分一点吗！？|#0103Adv14_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:不想再安分了。<br>大家似乎都已经到极限了。|#0103Adv14_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0103Adv14_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和艾玛<br>也感觉到了那种氛围吧？|#0103Adv14_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛沉默了。<br>雪莉说的话，她有头绪。|#0103Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（像着了魔似的<br>　一直在看书的玛格……）|#0103Adv14_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（逃避现实，<br>　沉浸在妄想世界里的可可……）|#0103Adv14_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（而且最主要的是——梅露露,<br>　她竟然会哭成那样）|#0103Adv14_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（雪莉说得对，<br>　大家都已经快到极限了）|#0103Adv14_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:我想要反抗，<br>不想什么都做不了。|#0103Adv14_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是闹事也是……|#0103Adv14_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_177 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉充耳不闻，<br>只管继续破坏图书室。|#0103Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和艾玛目前<br>只能旁观着这一切。|#0103Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也……讨厌这样……|#0103Adv14_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，做这种事情，<br>什么都改变不了啊……|#0103Adv14_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:站在一旁的汉娜握紧拳头，颤抖着。<br>眼角泛着泪光。|#0103Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这个笨蛋。<br>真是个笨蛋……|#0103Adv14_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么把天才说成是笨蛋呢～！|#0103Adv14_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:肌肉笨蛋，不识空气的臭女人。|#0103Adv14_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:偶尔也夸夸我嘛！|#0103Adv14_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_177 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:即使破坏书架，<br>也找不到能逃脱的线索。|#0103Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（太令人心痛了，雪莉……）|#0103Adv14_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（雪莉也是被压力击垮了吗……<br>　不，这么说的话）|#0103Adv14_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可、玛格、梅露露、<br>　亚里沙、汉娜也是）|#0103Adv14_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（连我也是——）|#0103Adv14_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（可能会变成魔女——）|#0103Adv14_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:意识到这个显而易见的事实时，<br>艾玛感觉脚下一阵晃动。|#0103Adv14_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——太过分了！|#0103Adv14_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，一声悲痛的叫喊在图书室内响起。|#0103Adv14_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格察觉到骚动赶来了。<br>她慌忙跑向散落的书本。|#0103Adv14_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们都愣住了。<br>她们第一次看到玛格如此慌张。|#0103Adv14_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格把书本都收拢到身边，<br>深深地叹了口气。|#0103Adv14_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里的书写着非常重要的内容。<br>希望你们能好好珍惜。|#0103Adv14_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:啊太好了，书没事……|#0103Adv14_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『魔女の本』表示
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格似乎找到了想要的书，<br>小心翼翼地抱在胸前松了口气。|#0103Adv14_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:本想着大家可能会想看，我才放在这里的。<br>看来我还是应该把它放在自己身边。|#0103Adv14_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:……那是之前给我们看的那本书吧？|#0103Adv14_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:是的，这是非常重要的书。<br>我打算用这本书上记载的内容进行实验，<br>不，是举行仪式。|#0103Adv14_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:仪式！？要做什么！？|#0103Adv14_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:……我不想告诉你们。<br>失陪了。|#0103Adv14_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格冷冷地说完就离开了。<br>艾玛和汉娜面面相觑。|#0103Adv14_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:她是不是觉得我们也是搞乱图书室的帮凶……？|#0103Adv14_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太糟糕了！我明明什么都没做！|#0103Adv14_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉你到底要给我们添多少麻烦啊！？<br>快来收拾！|#0103Adv14_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜一边抱怨一边开始捡拾书本。<br>艾玛也加入了整理工作。|#0103Adv14_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

